==English==

===Adverb===
'''[[next]] [[to]]'''

# {{idiomatic}} [[almost|Almost]]; [[nearly]].
#: ''It is '''next to''' impossible to get him to admit it, but he writes very well.''

===Preposition===
{{en-prep|pos=[[next]] [[to]]}}

# [[beside|Beside]]; [[alongside]].
#: ''Do you mind if I sit '''next to''' you?''
# Immediately [[following]] or [[preceding]] in a [[sequence]]; just [[subsequent]] or [[previous]].
#: ''When you start the '''next to''' the last roll, get some more paper.''

